---
layout: base.njk
title: "In the Media: podcasts, videos and interviews"
description: "Jari Laru in the media: interviews, podcasts, videos, articles and public expert roles related to education, technology, AI and politics."
permalink: /en/media/
lang: en
translationKey: media_index
schemaType: CollectionPage
---

{% set mediaItems = mediaArchive.all or [] %}
{% set mediaAbout = mediaArchive.about or [] %}
{% set mediaAssignments = mediaArchive.expertAssignments or [] %}
{% set mediaGuest = mediaArchive.guest or [] %}
{% set mediaInterviewer = mediaArchive.interviewer or [] %}
{% set mediaTotal = mediaItems | length %}
{% set mediaArticles = [] %}
{% set mediaPodcasts = [] %}
{% set mediaVideos = [] %}
{% set mediaAudio = [] %}
{% for item in mediaItems %}
  {% if item.data.mediaType == "article" %}
    {% set _ = (mediaArticles.push(item), null) %}
  {% elif item.data.mediaType == "podcast" %}
    {% set _ = (mediaPodcasts.push(item), null) %}
  {% elif item.data.mediaType == "video" %}
    {% set _ = (mediaVideos.push(item), null) %}
  {% elif item.data.mediaType == "radio" %}
    {% set _ = (mediaAudio.push(item), null) %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% macro itemUrl(item) %}
  {{ item.data.sourceUrl or item.url }}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro mediaTypeLabel(type) %}
  {% if type == "podcast" %}Podcast
  {% elif type == "assignment" %}Expert assignment
  {% elif type == "article" %}Article
  {% elif type == "tv" %}TV
  {% elif type == "radio" %}Radio
  {% elif type == "video" %}Video
  {% else %}Media
  {% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro roleLabel(role) %}
  {% if role == "about" %}About my work
  {% elif role == "expertAssignment" %}Expert role
  {% elif role == "interviewer" %}As interviewer
  {% elif role == "guest" %}As guest
  {% else %}Media
  {% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

<section class="py-5 border-bottom bg-body-tertiary">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <div class="row g-4 align-items-center">
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <p class="text-uppercase fw-bold small text-muted mb-2">Media appearances</p>
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3">In the Media</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-3">This page collects media appearances and public expert roles: articles, podcasts, videos, radio interviews, working groups and other content where I am involved.</p>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4"><a href="/en/writings/">Writings</a> collects self-authored texts and statements. <a href="/en/presentations/">Presentations</a> collects my talks, slides and materials. This view shows how the work appears in material produced by others.</p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <a href="#media-archive" class="btn btn-primary rounded-pill px-4">Browse media</a>
          <a href="#media-roles" class="btn btn-outline-secondary rounded-pill px-4">See roles</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <dl class="row g-2 mb-0 text-center">
          <div class="col-6">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-3 border bg-body h-100">
              <dd class="h2 fw-bold mb-0">{{ mediaTotal }}</dd>
              <dt class="small text-muted">media items</dt>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-3 border bg-body h-100">
              <dd class="h2 fw-bold mb-0">{{ mediaArticles | length }}</dd>
              <dt class="small text-muted">articles</dt>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-3 border bg-body h-100">
              <dd class="h2 fw-bold mb-0">{{ mediaPodcasts | length }}</dd>
              <dt class="small text-muted">podcasts</dt>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-3 border bg-body h-100">
              <dd class="h2 fw-bold mb-0">{{ mediaVideos | length }}</dd>
              <dt class="small text-muted">videos</dt>
            </div>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5 border-bottom" id="media-roles">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <p class="text-uppercase fw-bold small text-muted mb-1">Public role</p>
      <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-2">Four ways of appearing in public material</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-0">The role helps interpret each item: is the piece about my work, am I a guest, am I interviewing someone, or is the item an official expert assignment?</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-3">
      <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
        <div class="h-100 p-4 rounded-4 border bg-body-tertiary">
          <span class="display-6 fw-bold text-primary">{{ mediaAbout | length }}</span>
          <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mt-2">About my work</h3>
          <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Articles, podcasts and videos where the topic is my work, expertise or public role.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
        <div class="h-100 p-4 rounded-4 border bg-body-tertiary">
          <span class="display-6 fw-bold text-primary">{{ mediaAssignments | length }}</span>
          <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mt-2">Expert roles</h3>
          <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Working groups, expert panels and public assignments connected to university work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
        <div class="h-100 p-4 rounded-4 border bg-body-tertiary">
          <span class="display-6 fw-bold text-primary">{{ mediaGuest | length }}</span>
          <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mt-2">As guest</h3>
          <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Discussions and podcasts where I participate as an invited guest or expert.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-3">
        <div class="h-100 p-4 rounded-4 border bg-body-tertiary">
          <span class="display-6 fw-bold text-primary">{{ mediaInterviewer | length }}</span>
          <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mt-2">As interviewer</h3>
          <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Content where my role is to ask questions, host or guide the conversation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5 bg-body-tertiary border-bottom" id="media-archive">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <p class="text-uppercase fw-bold small text-muted mb-1">Archive</p>
      <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-2">All media appearances</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-0">Open the original source when available, or the local detail page for additional metadata and context.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-3">
      {% for item in mediaItems %}
      <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
        <article class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
          {% if item.data.thumbnail %}
          <a href="{{ itemUrl(item) | trim }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <img src="{{ item.data.thumbnail }}" alt="" class="card-img-top" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </a>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column">
            <p class="small text-muted mb-2">
              {{ mediaTypeLabel(item.data.mediaType) }} · {{ roleLabel(item.data.mediaRole) }}
              {% if item.data.mediaOutlet %} · {{ item.data.mediaOutlet }}{% endif %}
              {% if item.date %} · {{ item.date | dateFormat }}{% endif %}
            </p>
            <h3 class="h6 fw-bold"><a href="{{ itemUrl(item) | trim }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h3>
            {% if item.data.description %}
            <p class="small text-muted">{{ item.data.description | truncate(170) }}</p>
            {% endif %}
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
              <a href="{{ itemUrl(item) | trim }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3">Open source</a>
              <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3">Details (FI)</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5" id="media-links">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <div class="p-4 rounded-4 border">
      <p class="text-uppercase fw-bold small text-muted mb-1">Related routes</p>
      <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">Media is one public-facing layer of the same expertise</h2>
      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <a href="/en/writings/" class="btn btn-outline-primary rounded-pill px-4">Self-authored writings</a>
        <a href="/en/presentations/" class="btn btn-outline-primary rounded-pill px-4">Presentations and materials</a>
        <a href="/en/research/" class="btn btn-outline-primary rounded-pill px-4">Research</a>
        <a href="/en/politics/" class="btn btn-outline-primary rounded-pill px-4">Politics</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
